'''Nita''' (Japanese: '''ラニュイ''' ''Lanuit'') is one of the four {{tc|Battle Chatelaine|leaders}} of the [[Battle Maison]] in [[Pokémon X and Y|Pokémon X, Y]], [[Pokémon Omega Ruby and Alpha Sapphire|Omega Ruby, and Alpha Sapphire]], alongside her sisters [[Evelyn]], [[Dana]], and [[Morgan]].

==In the core series games==
Nita is the leader of the {{pkmn|battle|Single Battle}} format of the [[Battle Maison]], as well as the youngest of the {{tc|Battle Chatelaine}} sisters. Nita can be battled once the {{player}} has acquired a 19-win streak. Nita will later appear in the Super Single Battle once the player has acquired a 49-win streak. 

In the Super [[Multi Battle]] format, Nita can be battled alongside [[Morgan]] or [[Dana]] once the player has reached a 49-win streak. She will use, at random, two of the three Pokémon from her Super Single Battle team.

