==In the manga==
[[File:Nita Adventures.png|150px|thumb|Nita in [[Pokémon Adventures]]]]
===Pokémon Adventures===
Nita debuted in ''[[PS582|Pinsir Glares]]''. At the shore of [[Kiloude City]], she found an unconscious {{adv|Blaine}}, who was injured after being sent flying by the [[ultimate weapon]]'s blast. She informed the other Battle Chatelaines, and they took Blaine to the [[Battle Maison]], where he was allowed to rest and recuperate. Later, in ''[[PS587|Malamar Traps]]'', Nita and her sisters saw a recovered Blaine off.
